==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Doge Base]].
*8 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*4 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 1.67~5 seconds<sup>50f~150f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[M. Ost]] spawns as the boss.
**16 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**8 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn, delay 10~15 seconds<sup>300f~450f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A really simple stage. It might look intimidating at first, but there is one thing about this stage that makes this stage extremely easy: M. Ost. Assuming you bring a wave blocker like [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]], M. Ost will knock back and slow your wave blocker, allowing it to block the Doge Base's waves without taking damage from the frontline. This makes the Doge Base a negligible threat, and you can just spam [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapstick Cats]] to take down both M. Ost and the peons.

